@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@* For the phone view: nothing round the page but the page. The sidebar, the command
   palette and the banners are MainLayout's, and each of them is either furniture for a
   desk or something the phone view already says itself — maintenance and "can't see the
   lab" are at the top of it, with their buttons, rather than above it twice.

   The reconnect notice lives in App.razor, outside every layout, so a phone that loses
   the connection on the train still says so. *@
<main class="phone-shell">
    @Body
</main>

<div id="blazor-error-ui" class="alert alert-danger m-0 rounded-0 position-fixed bottom-0 start-0 end-0" style="display:none; z-index:1080">
    An error has occurred. <a href="" class="alert-link">Reload</a>
    <a class="float-end" href="" data-dismiss>✕</a>
</div>
